          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya qara ka jia sadeeso, ka ganna kud'ani tokeeso, ka nu haga nu boojiani teenne, AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, waan atini hayyu Misiritiifi gumi isaa ch'ufaani jettu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba amma tana anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, waan mukhi d'eerate duumansa gahu sunini tahu siti hima. Inni akuma bahe old'eeratuni ufi saada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tanaafi anini isa dide, harka hayyu lafa d'ibiti kenna. Inni ch'ubbu mukha suni gula waan isaa male tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti d'ibiini, ta naasu inqamne, d'ufte isa murte, qaarifte yaalabaati. Dameeleeni isaa ch'ufti gaara gubbafi bale ch'ufa keesati jidde, gochiti qara isaa jala boqatu taani ch'ufti kaate biraa yaati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simpirreeni d'ufte mukha qaarie suni ira teteete, bineensi alalleni d'ufe dameele isaa ira yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi armaa achi mukhi tokoleeni, ato haga fed'u madda gubba ejele, deebie haga mukha suni ind'eeratu, yokhaani old'eerate fiit'eeni isaaleeni dumansa intut'u. Mukhi ch'ufti, akuma namaa due boola ekhera d'aqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Guyya mukhi sunini due boola ekhera d'aqu, anini bisaani madda iti fach'aasa, aka wonti sunini akheekha boha taatufi. Ammalle anini yaasuma galaana kute, madda heddule yau d'owa. Waan mukhi kunini duefi, anini gaareeni Lebanoni ch'ufa dukaneese mukha badda isiile ch'ufa gogosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja anini mukha suni boola ekhera keesa buusu, dibbeesi lafa d'aicha isaa gosa ch'ufa chochoosa. Qaariitini isaa suni mukha Edeni ch'ufafi mukeeni Lebanoni ta bisaani burqa gubba ejaanjitu ch'ufa ta boola ekhera d'at'e, guddo gammachiifti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukeeni sunini ch'ufti, mukha suni woliini, gara mukeeni duru qaqarite, ta boola ekhera keesa jirtu taani, d'at'i. Ammalle nama gaadisa mukha suni jala boqotu kaani ch'ufa gosa ch'ufa keesati firfirsani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhi sunini hayyu Misiritiifi nama isaa ch'ufa. Mukhi tokoleeni ka Edeni keesa jiru, ka akasi d'eerate mid'aagu, tokoleeni injiru. Ammo amma tana akuma mukeeni Edeni taani, mukhi suni boola ekhera d'aqe, worra Waaqa imbeenneefi ka woraanaani d'umeti darama. Nami waan kana jed'u ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka hayyu Misiri nyaachaani wolkeesani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
